{"id":"bs09","name":"Daily Cancellation Rate","lang":"sql","entry":null,"params":[],"limit_s":10,"ordered":true,"desc":"<p>A ride-hailing company audits its cancellations. You have two tables.</p>\n<p><b>trips</b>: <code>id</code>, <code>client_id</code>, <code>driver_id</code>, <code>city_id</code>, <code>status</code> and <code>request_at</code> (date). <code>status</code> is <code>'completed'</code>, <code>'cancelled_by_driver'</code> or <code>'cancelled_by_client'</code>.</p>\n<p><b>users</b>: <code>users_id</code>, <code>banned</code> (<code>'Yes'</code> or <code>'No'</code>) and <code>role</code> (<code>'client'</code> or <code>'driver'</code>).</p>\n<p>The <b>cancellation rate</b> of a day is the number of cancelled trips (by the client or by the driver) divided by the number of trips of that day, counting <b>only the trips where neither the client nor the driver is banned</b>.</p>\n<p>Your task is to return, for every day between <code>2026-10-01</code> and <code>2026-10-03</code> (both included) that has at least one such trip, the columns <code>day</code> and <code>cancellation_rate</code> rounded to <code>2</code> decimals, sorted by <code>day</code>.</p>\n<h4>Example</h4><p>Table <code>trips</code>:</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>id</th><th>client_id</th><th>driver_id</th><th>city_id</th><th>status</th><th>request_at</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>1</td><td>10</td><td>1</td><td>completed</td><td>2026-10-01</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>2</td><td>11</td><td>1</td><td>cancelled_by_driver</td><td>2026-10-01</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>12</td><td>6</td><td>completed</td><td>2026-10-01</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>4</td><td>13</td><td>6</td><td>cancelled_by_client</td><td>2026-10-01</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>1</td><td>10</td><td>1</td><td>completed</td><td>2026-10-02</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>2</td><td>11</td><td>6</td><td>completed</td><td>2026-10-02</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>3</td><td>12</td><td>6</td><td>completed</td><td>2026-10-02</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>2</td><td>12</td><td>12</td><td>completed</td><td>2026-10-03</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>3</td><td>10</td><td>12</td><td>completed</td><td>2026-10-03</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>4</td><td>13</td><td>12</td><td>cancelled_by_driver</td><td>2026-10-03</td></tr></table></div><p>Table <code>users</code>:</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>users_id</th><th>banned</th><th>role</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>No</td><td>client</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Yes</td><td>client</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>No</td><td>client</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>No</td><td>client</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>No</td><td>driver</td></tr><tr><td>11</td><td>No</td><td>driver</td></tr><tr><td>12</td><td>No</td><td>driver</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>No</td><td>driver</td></tr></table></div><p>the output should be</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>day</th><th>cancellation_rate</th></tr><tr><td>2026-10-01</td><td>0.33</td></tr><tr><td>2026-10-02</td><td>0.0</td></tr><tr><td>2026-10-03</td><td>0.5</td></tr></table></div><div class=\"lim\"><b>[execution time limit]</b> 10 seconds (psql)<br><b>[memory limit]</b> 1 GB</div>","starter":"/* Write your PostgreSQL query here */\n","hints":["Joins users deux fois (une pour le client, une pour le chauffeur) et garde banned = 'No' des deux côtés.","Le taux : ROUND(SUM(CASE WHEN status <> 'completed' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)::numeric / COUNT(*), 2). Sans ::numeric, la division entière donne 0."],"summary_fr":"Pour chaque jour du 1er au 3 octobre 2026, calculer le taux d'annulation des courses où ni le client ni le chauffeur n'est banni. Une course annulée par l'un ou l'autre compte.","tags":["double jointure","filtre bannis","division entière","ROUND"],"minutes":18,"source":"shawlu95/Beyond-LeetCode-SQL (MIT) · Trips and Users (LeetCode 262)","files":null,"visible":[{"input":{"tables":{"trips":{"columns":[["id","INT"],["client_id","INT"],["driver_id","INT"],["city_id","INT"],["status","VARCHAR(25)"],["request_at","DATE"]],"rows":[[1,1,10,1,"completed","2026-10-01"],[2,2,11,1,"cancelled_by_driver","2026-10-01"],[3,3,12,6,"completed","2026-10-01"],[4,4,13,6,"cancelled_by_client","2026-10-01"],[5,1,10,1,"completed","2026-10-02"],[6,2,11,6,"completed","2026-10-02"],[7,3,12,6,"completed","2026-10-02"],[8,2,12,12,"completed","2026-10-03"],[9,3,10,12,"completed","2026-10-03"],[10,4,13,12,"cancelled_by_driver","2026-10-03"]]},"users":{"columns":[["users_id","INT"],["banned","VARCHAR(3)"],["role","VARCHAR(10)"]],"rows":[[1,"No","client"],[2,"Yes","client"],[3,"No","client"],[4,"No","client"],[10,"No","driver"],[11,"No","driver"],[12,"No","driver"],[13,"No","driver"]]}}},"expected":{"columns":["day","cancellation_rate"],"rows":[["2026-10-01",0.33],["2026-10-02",0.0],["2026-10-03",0.5]]}},{"input":{"tables":{"trips":{"columns":[["id","INT"],["client_id","INT"],["driver_id","INT"],["city_id","INT"],["status","VARCHAR(25)"],["request_at","DATE"]],"rows":[[1,1,10,1,"cancelled_by_client","2026-09-30"],[2,1,13,1,"cancelled_by_driver","2026-10-02"],[3,3,13,1,"completed","2026-10-02"],[4,3,11,1,"completed","2026-10-02"],[5,4,12,1,"completed","2026-10-04"]]},"users":{"columns":[["users_id","INT"],["banned","VARCHAR(3)"],["role","VARCHAR(10)"]],"rows":[[1,"No","client"],[3,"No","client"],[4,"No","client"],[10,"No","driver"],[11,"No","driver"],[12,"No","driver"],[13,"No","driver"]]}}},"expected":{"columns":["day","cancellation_rate"],"rows":[["2026-10-02",0.33]]}}],"hidden_n":6,"hidden":"","solution":""}